AutoScene
=========

AutoScene is an independent modified work based on OpenMontage:
https://github.com/calesthio/OpenMontage

Original OpenMontage authorship and contributor attribution are preserved by
the fork's retained Git history and documented in UPSTREAM.md. The applicable
GNU Affero General Public License version 3 terms are retained in LICENSE.

Beat-synchronized editing, TimelineV2 integration, and procedural 3D pipeline
modifications were added in 2026. The optional Recordly integration is an
external exported-MP4 bridge and includes no Recordly code or assets. No
affiliation with or endorsement by the upstream maintainers is implied.

Third-party dependencies and user-supplied content have separate terms. See
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and docs/ASSET_PROVENANCE.md.
